<title>USA: NuSkin to offer 7.6 mln shares in IPO.</title>
<headline>NuSkin to offer 7.6 mln shares in IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nu Skin Asia Pacific Inc plans an initial public offering of 7.6 million common shares at an expected price of $20 to $22 a share, according to underwriter Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p>Proceeds are expected to be about $160 million.</p>
<p>Of the shares, 4.6 million would be offered in the United States and three million shares would be offered overseas.</p>
<p>The offering is due sometime during the week of November 18.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
